---
/**
 * @license MIT
 * ============================================================================
 * src/pages/index.astro — Engine Room Records Home Route (`/`)
 * ============================================================================
 * PLAIN-ENGLISH OVERVIEW (100-LEVEL JAVASCRIPT & ASTRO 6 GUIDE):
 * What is this file?
 *   In Astro 6, every `.astro` file inside `src/pages/` defines a public URL
 *   route using "file-based routing." Because this file is named `index.astro`
 *   at the root of `src/pages/`, it represents the site's home page (`/`).
 *
 * How does it fit into the build lifecycle?
 *   - Route Blueprint: Declares the canonical SEO title, description, and path
 *     for `/` wrapped inside `BaseLayout.astro`.
 *   - Data Hydration (`scripts/build.mjs` + `src/renderers/pages-core.mjs`):
 *     During `npm run build`, `renderHomePage(catalog)` reads the live album and
 *     track manifest (`raggiesoft-assets/engine-room-records/catalog.json`) plus
 *     `src/data/artistLore.mjs` and writes `./dist/index.html`.
 *
 * What visible UI does the `/` page produce?
 *   1. Pillar 1 ("What Kind of Music Do I Make?"): Interactive roster cards for
 *      all Engine Room Records bands with direct streaming handoff links to
 *      The Listening Room (`https://music.raggiesoft.com`).
 *   2. Pillar 2 ("Behind the Scenes on Music Generation"): Summary cards for our
 *      human + AI studio pipeline, phonetic vowel extensions, and 75% Cover rule.
 *   3. Pillar 3 ("The Corporate Entity"): Side-by-side distinction between the
 *      real-world unincorporated brand (**Engine Room Records**, never "LLC") and
 *      the fictional in-universe conglomerate (*Engine Room Records, LLC*).
 *   4. Closed Submission Policy: Explicit notice that unsolicited demos are deleted.
 * ============================================================================
 */

// Import the shared outer HTML document layout from `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro`.
// Remember: JavaScript inside `--- ... ---` runs strictly at build time!
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<!--
  Pass page-specific metadata props (`title`, `description`, `canonicalPath`) into
  our BaseLayout component. Anything placed inside BaseLayout's opening and closing
  tags is projected into BaseLayout's slot placeholder.
-->
<BaseLayout
  title="Engine Room Records | Official Imprint & Studio Hub"
  description="What kind of music do I make? Explore all 7 Engine Room Records bands, studio engineering, and our dual-layer corporate lore."
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <!-- Static HTML body hydrated from catalog.json and artistLore.mjs via renderHomePage() in scripts/build.mjs -->
</BaseLayout>
